<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore oil markets closed Thursday.</title>
<headline>Singapore oil markets closed Thursday.</headline>
<text>
<p>ADVISORY - Oil markets in Singapore are closed on Thursday to mark Labour Day holiday.</p>
<p>The Brent market on SIMEX will be open however between 0125 GMT and 0858 GMT, but all other energy markets are closed. Singapore energy markets reopen on Friday.</p>
<p>Japan's energy markets are open.</p>
</text>
